    {
      "record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C01_008_01_B:008_01_B_008:3bb84863",
      "source": {
        "set": "set-02",
        "namespace": "ST_C01_008_01_B",
        "key": "008_01_B_008",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C01_008_01_B:008_01_B_008:3bb84863",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C01_008_01_B:008_01_B_008:3bb84863",
        "jp_sha256": "24746a8657d6e31838efb5239799c8c913771e8a5ce76e278f6d3d7d625e570f",
        "official_en_sha256": "272ec3c5781a757b2c5738bf81c991b8b8417a85125ba24ff76cc2c458d9f359"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "けど、なんでそんなことになるんだ？\r\nクリスタルが神聖なものであることは\r\nわかるんだけどさ。",
        "official_en": "I know that the Crystals are special, but...I just can’t get my head around how they could be related to that level of chaos.",
        "real_en": "But why would destroying them cause that? I know the Crystals are sacred, but..."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
      "function": "dialogue_line",
      "context": {
        "scene_ref": "ST_C01_008_01_B",
        "sequence": null,
        "speaker": {
