    {
      "record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C01_008_01_B:008_01_B_006:6e162967",
      "source": {
        "set": "set-02",
        "namespace": "ST_C01_008_01_B",
        "key": "008_01_B_006",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C01_008_01_B:008_01_B_006:6e162967",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C01_008_01_B:008_01_B_006:6e162967",
        "jp_sha256": "b4f951e5d923411042a9d2785849e075dfc28434830498ac263c1714ad74f30d",
        "official_en_sha256": "bf25c806f4b37c94e9f24fe21da45d05c21b5ab2bb233b239a8f509d01332e23"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "だから、神殿に結界を張り\r\n何百年も昔から各国で守っているんだ。",
        "official_en": "That’s why each shrine is protected with a barrier, and overseen by its respective nation.",
        "real_en": "That’s why each nation has protected its shrine with a barrier for hundreds of years."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
