      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "城に戻ったら調べてみるか。\r\nラスウェルが。",
        "official_en": "You’ll have to look into this when we get back to the castle, Lasswell.",
        "real_en": "Maybe we should look into it when we get back to the castle. Or rather, Lasswell can."
